{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"熟悉的歌唱与舞曲只剩轻弱、断续的碎片；摇篮曲也像在F小调里破碎重现\",\"source\":\"它们既像先前如歌旋律的碎片，也像那些舞曲主题的残片；另一种更凄厉哀婉的听法，是听见先前那段摇篮曲破碎地重现，只是这次变成了F小调。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿把摇篮曲明确标为另一种听法，屏幕稿用“也”接在歌唱、舞曲碎片之后，容易让人理解为三者同时出现，而非两种不同的听法。\"},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"每次爆发之后，紧张仍没有解除，反而又形成新的压力\",\"source\":\"每次爆发之后，紧张都没有完全解除，反而又形成新的压力。\",\"type\":\"8\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"删去“完全”后，变成紧张一点也没有解除，比定稿表达得更绝对，丢失了紧张有所缓解但未彻底消退的程度区别。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1d027ec9-dbbd-4fae-884a-8a97d2f72ad1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T031553789046Z", "elapsed_seconds": 170.265, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T03:18:44.057311+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c1170e0451717bc202e877b9ab2cc34ba31dfcbb1dbdd76e1299106431389947", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222